\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 1. Product Vision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 AI Engineering Radar is a public, continuously updated observatory tracking how AI-related engineering practices, workflows, and techniques evolve over time.\
Its primary purpose is to answer:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 What's happening in AI engineering right now, and how is it changing?
\f1\b0 \
The product is not a news portal, newsletter, recommendation engine, or technology adoption guide.\
It should allow visitors to quickly understand:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Which engineering topics are receiving increased attention.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Which topics are becoming less visible.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Which topics have recently emerged.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 How activity around individual topics has evolved.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 What credible sources support the observations.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Whether evidence describes discussion, experimentation, or actual production use.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The experience must be visual, minimal, and immediately understandable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1.1 Fundamental Principle\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Observe. Do not recommend.
\f1\b0 \
The radar must never imply that a popular topic is necessarily effective, valuable, or worth adopting.\
Do not introduce:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Adopt / Trial / Assess / Hold classifications.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Editorial recommendations.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 AI-generated adoption advice.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Best-practice rankings.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Subjective quality scores.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Unsupported claims about industry adoption.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Trend direction represents observed activity within the monitored source set, not engineering quality.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

