\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3.1 Source\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 A Source identifies an original publisher or monitored information channel.\
Suggested fields:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 type Source = \{\
  id: string;\
  name: string;\
  url: string;\
  type:\
    | "engineering-blog"\
    | "research"\
    | "documentation"\
    | "repository"\
    | "technical-talk"\
    | "other";\
  organization?: string;\
  independentGroup: string;\
  enabled: boolean;\
  discoveredAt: string;\
\};\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 independentGroup
\f1\fs24  helps prevent counting multiple channels from the same publisher as independent evidence.\
